---
// BeP09 figure: BeP09FakeCopy
---
<figure class="bep9n2">
  <div class="bep9n2-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 215" role="img" aria-label="Two stores compared. A dict that keeps the object you pass in shares one object with the caller, so a change you forgot to save still shows up and hides the bug. The fake copies the object in with replace and copies it out again, so a change you forgot to save stays forgotten, as with a real database.">
    <text x="230" y="28" text-anchor="middle" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>a dict that stores your object</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dict lưu chính object bạn đưa vào</tspan></text>
    <text x="670" y="28" text-anchor="middle" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>the fake: copy in, copy out</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>fake: copy khi vào, copy khi ra</tspan></text>
    <rect x="40" y="56" width="150" height="56" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="115" y="90" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>your object</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>object của bạn</tspan></text>
    <rect x="300" y="56" width="150" height="56" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="375" y="90" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>the dict</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cái dict</tspan></text>
    <line x1="190" y1="84" x2="290" y2="84" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="300,84 290,79 290,89" class="hd" />
    <text x="245" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>no copy</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không copy</tspan></text>
    <rect x="480" y="56" width="150" height="56" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="555" y="90" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>your object</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>object của bạn</tspan></text>
    <rect x="740" y="56" width="130" height="56" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="805" y="90" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>stored copy</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bản đã lưu</tspan></text>
    <line x1="630" y1="84" x2="730" y2="84" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="740,84 730,79 730,89" class="hd" />
    <text x="685" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="code">replace()</text>
    <text x="230" y="160" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>caller and "database" share one object</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>caller và "database" dùng chung một object</tspan></text>
    <text x="230" y="188" text-anchor="middle" class="redt"><tspan data-lang-en>a change you forgot to save shows up anyway</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>thay đổi bạn quên lưu vẫn hiện ra</tspan></text>
    <text x="670" y="160" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>add and get both copy, like a real database</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>add và get đều copy, như database thật</tspan></text>
    <text x="670" y="188" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>a change you forgot to save stays forgotten</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>thay đổi bạn quên lưu vẫn là chưa lưu</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The copies are what make a forgotten save visible. Without them the caller and the "database" are the same object and cannot disagree.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Chính các bản copy làm lỗi quên lưu lộ ra. Không có chúng, caller và "database" là cùng một object nên không thể bất đồng.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

